X: 1
T: The 11th of July
N: Longways for as many as will
N: Each Strain is to be play'd twice over.
B: Playford "The Dancing Master" 1718
N: The first Couple Sett and cast off below the second Couple.  This  is  to  the  first  Strain
N: play'd  once.   Then  Sett  and case off below the third Couple.  This is to the first Strain
N: play'd twice.  Then lead through to the top.  This is to the second Strain play'd once.  Then
N: cast off, and Right and Left quite round and turn. This is to the second Strain play'd twice.
M: 6/8
L: 1/8
K: D
